th, and your heroes are living proof.<br>Sometimes they\u2019ll land a Critical Hit, but far more often they\u2019ll stun themselves, hit an ally, or trip over their own ego. Every Critical Fail fills your Ubercharge meter faster, turning disaster into raw power. <br>So go ahead - miss that attack, burn your own party, and call it \u201cstrategy.\u201d<br>Pain is a valid build.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2090960/extras/449c755ae8a36109c525a637a99a1a80.poster.avif?t=1771573408\" width=1170 height=546 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2090960/extras/449c755ae8a36109c525a637a99a1a80.webm?t=1771573408\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2090960/extras/449c755ae8a36109c525a637a99a1a80.mp4?t=1771573408\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dungeons and Their (Odd) Inhabitants</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated dungeons aren\u2019t just a random set of corridors. They\u2019re hellish mazes packed with hundreds of enemies, traps, and weird characters ready to discuss everything except your inevitable death</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2090960/extras/9b17d559b3ca1addacbeec65c291b50c.poster.avif?t=1771573408\" width=1170 height=546 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2090960/extras/9b17d559b3ca1addacbeec65c291b50c.webm?t=1771573408\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2090960/extras/9b17d559b3ca1addacbeec65c291b50c.mp4?t=1771573408\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Heroes Who Don\u2019t Want to Die (But Will Anyway)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble a motley crew of heroes, each with unique talents and quirks, and head out to face new defeats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Permanent death ensures that your heroes will change often, and every decision will weigh as much as the last bottle of rum on a sinking ship!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2090960/extras/f670e75e33faf401106263e7a84ced7e.poster.avif?t=1771573408\" width=1170 height=546 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2090960/extras/f670e75e33faf401106263e7a84ced7e.webm?t=1771573408\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2090960/extras/f670e75e33faf401106263e7a84ced7e.mp4?t=1771573408\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customizable Difficulty Levels</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When our sales manager finally stopped crying, he said it was inhumane to torture players like that. We added fine-tuned difficulty settings so hardcore maniacs and newbies alike can find their perfect dose of adrenaline</p>","developers":["Red Dice Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2090960/29d65d015b586bc5cdb9e5261b1e39c3f1114845/header.jpg?t=1771573408","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2090960/519866932/3f92bf94756d6c823eb742d351f12ba4fd3bdeeb/1762274289/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762275509","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2090960/519866932/3f92bf94756d6c823eb742d351f12ba4fd3bdeeb/17622742